---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="For Growers | Kemitraan KSO Tambak & Solusi Petambak | NAUTERA" description="Dapatkan pendampingan SOP presisi, suplai pakan bermutu, serta jaminan serap panen kepastian harga bersama ekosistem KSO NAUTERA.">
<main>
<!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="hero-bg-media">
        <img src="/assets/images/bg-3.jpg" alt="" onerror="if(!this.dataset.tried){this.dataset.tried=1;this.src='/assets/images/hero-growers-bg.png';}else{this.style.display='none';}">
      </div>
      <div class="hero-overlay-grid"></div>
      <div class="container"> 
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="hero-content reveal">
            <h1>Farm Easy,<br>Get Better Harvest.</h1>
            <p>Didampingi tim ahli dari persiapan kolam hingga masa panen. Kelola tambak lebih tenang dengan SOP presisi, risiko terkendali, dan jaminan serapan pasar yang menguntungkan.</p>
            <div class="hero-float-card">
              <span class="hero-float-dot"></span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary-dark);">Pendampingan Aktif &bull; SOP Presisi &bull; Serapan Terjamin</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal delay-200" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

            <!-- Growers Ecosystem Control Dashboard Section (From Nature Light Theme) -->
    <section id="growers-diagram" class="growers-diagram-section dashboard-light-theme" style="padding: 5rem 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-top: 1px solid rgba(119,171,89,0.15); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(119,171,89,0.15);">
      
      <!-- Animated Background Glowing Orbs & Soft Grid -->
      <div class="dashboard-bg-grid" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px; opacity: 0.7; pointer-events: none;"></div>
      <div style="position: absolute; top: -20%; right: -10%; width: 500px; height: 500px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201, 223, 138, 0.35) 0%, transparent 70%); animation: floatSlow 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; pointer-events: none;"></div>
      <div style="position: absolute; bottom: -20%; left: -10%; width: 500px; height: 500px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.2) 0%, transparent 70%); animation: floatSlow 10s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse; pointer-events: none;"></div>

      <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
        
        <div class="section-header center reveal" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
          <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-light); padding: 0.45rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 30px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary-dark); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(35,76,32,0.06);">
            <span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #367F2D; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; animation: pulseGlow 1.5s infinite;"></span>
            LIVE ECOSYSTEM MONITORING &bull; 24/7 ACTIVE
          </div>
          <h2 style="color: var(--color-primary-dark); -webkit-text-stroke: 1.2px #000000; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Full Ecosystem Support for Every Grower</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-light); max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.05rem;">Mendukung setiap tahap operasional petambak melalui dashboard presisi terintegrasi &mdash; tata kelola SOP modern, SDM tersertifikasi, suplai saprotam presisi, hingga kepastian panen menguntungkan.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Dashboard Layout Grid -->
        <div class="dashboard-grid-wrapper" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 2rem; position: relative;">
          
          <!-- Connecting SVG Lines (Nautera Green Palette) -->
          <svg style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;" viewBox="0 0 1000 400" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="lineGradLeft" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#367F2D" stop-opacity="0.25"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#77AB59" stop-opacity="0.85"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <linearGradient id="lineGradRight" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#77AB59" stop-opacity="0.85"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#367F2D" stop-opacity="0.25"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <!-- Line to Top-Left Card -->
            <path d="M 500 200 C 400 200, 340 85, 290 85" fill="none" stroke="url(#lineGradLeft)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 6">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" from="24" to="0" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </path>
            <!-- Line to Bottom-Left Card -->
            <path d="M 500 200 C 400 200, 340 315, 290 315" fill="none" stroke="url(#lineGradLeft)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 6">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" from="24" to="0" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </path>
            <!-- Line to Top-Right Card -->
            <path d="M 500 200 C 600 200, 660 85, 710 85" fill="none" stroke="url(#lineGradRight)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 6">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" from="0" to="24" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </path>
            <!-- Line to Bottom-Right Card -->
            <path d="M 500 200 C 600 200, 660 315, 710 315" fill="none" stroke="url(#lineGradRight)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 6">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" from="0" to="24" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </path>
          </svg>

          <!-- Column Left: System & SDM -->
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; position: relative; z-index: 2;">
            
            <!-- Dashboard Card 1: NAUTERA SYSTEM -->
            <div class="dash-card-light reveal-left delay-100">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;">
                  <span style="background: var(--color-primary-very-light); color: var(--color-primary); padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-flex;">
                    <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">NAUTERA SYSTEM</h4>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-primary-very-light); border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-light); color: var(--color-primary-dark); padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700;">SOP ACTIVE</span>
              </div>
              <p style="color: var(--color-text-light); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Tata kelola tambak modern berbasis SOP harian presisi dan otomatisasi data parameter air.</p>
              
              <div style="background: rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.15); border-radius: 10px; height: 8px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
                <div class="dash-progress-fill" data-progress-target="94.8" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #367F2D, #77AB59); border-radius: 10px; animation: shimmerBar 2.5s infinite linear; transition: width 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);"></div>
              </div>
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-primary-dark); margin-top: 0.45rem; font-weight: 700;">
                <span>Precision Compliance</span>
                <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;"><span class="hero-float-dot" style="width: 6px; height: 6px;"></span><span class="live-percent-counter" data-percent-target="94.8">0.0%</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dashboard Card 2: NAUTERA SDM -->
            <div class="dash-card-light reveal-left delay-300">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;">
                  <span style="background: var(--color-primary-very-light); color: var(--color-primary); padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-flex;">
                    <img src="/assets/images/shrimp-mascot.png" alt="SDM Mascot" style="width: 24px; height: 24px; object-fit: contain;">
                  </span>
                  <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">NAUTERA SDM</h4>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-primary-very-light); border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-light); color: var(--color-primary-dark); padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700;">CERTIFIED</span>
              </div>
              <p style="color: var(--color-text-light); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Didampingi teknisi lapangan terlatih dan bersertifikat Nautera Academy 24/7.</p>
              
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; background: var(--color-primary-very-light); border: 1px solid rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.2); padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 12px;">
                <div style="width: 10px; height: 10px; background: #367F2D; border-radius: 50%; animation: pulseGlow 1.2s infinite;"></div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-weight: 700;">120+ Teknisi Aktif Mendampingi</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Column Center: Glowing Interactive Core Reactor Node -->
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; position: relative; padding: 2rem 0; z-index: 2;">
            
            <!-- Animated Green Theme Rings -->
            <svg style="position: absolute; width: 280px; height: 280px; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); pointer-events: none; z-index: 1; overflow: visible;" viewBox="0 0 280 280">
              <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="130" fill="none" stroke="rgba(119,171,89,0.2)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="130" fill="none" stroke="#77AB59" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="10 24" stroke-linecap="round">
                <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 140 140" to="360 140 140" dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
              </circle>
              <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="105" fill="none" stroke="rgba(54,127,45,0.3)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="105" fill="none" stroke="#367F2D" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 18" stroke-linecap="round">
                <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="360 140 140" to="0 140 140" dur="14s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
              </circle>
            </svg>

            <!-- Core Hub Badge -->
            <div class="dash-core-hub-light reveal-scale delay-200" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
              <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-lg" style="color: #F1F7DB; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; animation: floatSlow 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
              <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">NAUTERA CORE</h3>
              <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: #C9DF8A; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3;">Precision Farm Management</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Realtime Metrics Ticker -->
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem; position: relative; z-index: 2; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-light); border-radius: 30px; padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-weight: 800; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(35,76,32,0.06);">
              <span style="color: var(--color-primary);">STATUS:</span> OPTIMAL HARVEST YIELD</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Column Right: Supply & Harvest -->
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
            
            <!-- Dashboard Card 3: NAUTERA SUPPLY -->
            <div class="dash-card-light reveal-right delay-100">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;">
                  <span style="background: var(--color-primary-very-light); color: var(--color-primary); padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-flex;">
                    <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">NAUTERA SUPPLY</h4>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-primary-very-light); border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-light); color: var(--color-primary-dark); padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700;">HIGH QUALITY</span>
              </div>
              <p style="color: var(--color-text-light); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Benur SPF teruji, pakan bernutrisi tinggi, dan saprotam lengkap disuplai tepat waktu.</p>
              
              <div style="background: rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.15); border-radius: 10px; height: 8px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
                <div class="dash-progress-fill" data-progress-target="98.6" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #367F2D, #77AB59); border-radius: 10px; animation: shimmerBar 2.2s infinite linear; transition: width 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);"></div>
              </div>
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-primary-dark); margin-top: 0.45rem; font-weight: 700;">
                <span>Stock Readiness</span>
                <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;"><span class="hero-float-dot" style="width: 6px; height: 6px;"></span><span class="live-percent-counter" data-percent-target="98.6">0.0%</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dashboard Card 4: NAUTERA HARVEST -->
            <div class="dash-card-light reveal-right delay-300">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;">
                  <span style="background: var(--color-primary-very-light); color: var(--color-primary); padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-flex;">
                    <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 16v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/><path d="M18 8l4 4-4 4M22 12H9"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">NAUTERA HARVEST</h4>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-primary-very-light); border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-light); color: var(--color-primary-dark); padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700;">GUARANTEED</span>
              </div>
              <p style="color: var(--color-text-light); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Kepastian serapan hasil panen dengan timbangan jujur tanpa glazing dan harga adil.</p>
              
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; background: var(--color-primary-very-light); border: 1px solid rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.2); padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 12px;">
                <div style="width: 10px; height: 10px; background: #367F2D; border-radius: 50%; animation: pulseGlow 1s infinite;"></div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-weight: 700;">Guaranteed Market Offtake</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Nautera System Section -->
    <section id="nautera-system" class="growers-sub-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 4rem; align-items: flex-end;">
          <div class="reveal">
            <span class="section-label">Model Kemitraan</span>
            <h2>Precision Farm Operations &amp; Trained Workforce</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal delay-200">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">NAUTERA SYSTEM</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Kami menghadirkan skema Kerja Sama Operasional (KSO) berbasis SOP presisi harian dan pengawalan teknisi terlatih untuk memastikan tambak Anda berproduksi stabil, efisien, dan menguntungkan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; background-color: var(--color-primary-very-light); border-color: var(--color-primary-light); padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">KSO TAMBAK (Kerja Sama Operasional)</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 0;">
            Nautera System adalah tata kelola tambak vaname yang menggabungkan kedisiplinan SOP harian dengan keahlian teknisi terlatih dari Nautera Academy untuk menjaga produktivitas tambak tetap stabil, efisien, dan menguntungkan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-2">
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div class="card reveal">
            <h3 style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;"><img src="/assets/images/shrimp-mascot.png" alt="Nautera Academy Mascot" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; object-fit: contain;"> SDM Bersertifikat Nautera Academy</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Dikelola oleh teknisi dan operator tambak terlatih yang dibekali pemahaman mendalam tentang biosecurity, manajemen air, dan kesiapsiagaan mitigasi risiko di lapangan.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div class="card reveal delay-100">
            <h3 style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i> Operasional Berbasis SOP Presisi</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Penerapan standar kerja baku yang konsisten di setiap siklus budidaya &mdash; mulai dari persiapan wadah, penebaran benur, hingga proses panen terjadwal.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div class="card reveal">
            <h3 style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i> Monitoring Parameter Air Harian</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Kedisiplinan check-list kualitas air dan pakan yang diukur secara teratur untuk menjaga kestabilan ekosistem kolam secara menyeluruh.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 4 -->
          <div class="card reveal delay-100">
            <h3 style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i> Analisis &amp; Optimasi FCR</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Kalkulasi laju pakan (feeding rate) dan perkiraan biomassa secara akurat untuk meningkatkan efisiensi biaya operasional dan hasil panen.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-center reveal" style="margin-top: 3.5rem;">
          <a href="/contact?type=grower" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 1rem 3rem;">GABUNG NAUTERA <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Nautera SDM & Academy Section -->
    <section id="academy-details" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.06);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 5.5rem;">
          <div class="reveal">
            <span class="section-label">NAUTERA SDM</span>
            <h2>Aquaculture Talent Development</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-primary-dark);">Membentuk praktisi dan teknisi tambak profesional yang terampil, disiplin memantau data harian, dan berintegritas untuk mengawal produktivitas tambak Anda.</p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">
              <a href="#academy-competency" class="btn btn-primary">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
              <a href="/contact?type=grower" class="btn btn-secondary">Hubungi kami</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal delay-200">
            <div class="img-slot" style="min-height: 350px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(35, 76, 32, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.12);">
              <img src="/assets/images/sdm.png" alt="Pelatihan Teknisi Lapangan" loading="lazy">
              <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">sdm-training.webp</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Competency Details Section -->
        <div id="academy-competency" class="grid-2" style="align-items: center; scroll-margin-top: 100px;">
          <div class="reveal">
            <div class="img-slot" style="min-height: 350px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(35, 76, 32, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.12);">
              <img src="/assets/images/aca.png" alt="Kelas Kimia Laboratorium Air" loading="lazy">
              <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">academy-class.webp</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal delay-200">
            <h2>Building Competence, Ensuring Quality</h2>
            <p>Keberhasilan tambak udang intensif ditentukan oleh keahlian, kejelian, dan rasa tanggung jawab dari Sumber Daya Manusia (SDM) yang mengelolanya sehari-hari.</p>
            <p>Nautera Academy menjembatani kesenjangan keahlian antara teori akuakultur akademik dan praktik lapangan tambak intensif melalui pelatihan berbasis data nyata, uji laboratorium parameter air, serta mitigasi risiko biosekuriti praktis.</p>
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
              <a href="/contact?type=grower" class="btn btn-primary">GABUNG ACADEMY NAUTERA <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Nautera Supply Section -->
    <section style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.06);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2">
